  "abstract": "Install and operate Prometheus, Alertmanager and Grafana for LLM serving. Covers a hardened Docker Compose stack, scrape configs for vLLM, llama.cpp, SGLang, llama-swap, LiteLLM and DCGM (and the Ollama gap), recording rules, dashboards, a 16-rule alert set with Alertmanager routing, remote_write and Alloy for managed backends, privacy of labels, updates and troubleshooting, with validated templates and a read-only health script.",
